  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed specifically for official payments to government agencies, pension funds, or insurance bodies. Not used for ordinary commercial transactions or personal payments.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {支払|しはら}い: payment (general, for any transaction)\n- {納税|のうぜい}: tax payment (specifically taxes)\n- {納入|のうにゅう}: delivery, payment (slightly broader, includes goods)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {税金|ぜいきん}を{納付|のうふ}する: pay taxes\n- {保険料|ほけんりょう}の{納付|のうふ}: payment of insurance premiums\n- {納付|のうふ}{期限|きげん}: payment deadline\n- {納付|のうふ}{書|しょ}: payment slip\n- {未納付|みのうふ}: non-payment, unpaid",
